[
  {
    "event": "hiroko_lv1_or_instrument_panic",
    "source_node": "A001",
    "speaker": "narrator",
    "source_text": "下午的手术室已经准备得差不多了。无影灯亮着，二十二岁的年轻女患者躺在手术台上，手术帽完全包住头发，身上盖着手术单。她还没有进入全身麻醉，目光紧张地在房间里四处游移。",
    "status": "not_exact_substring_in_current_nodes; requires revision provenance review"
  },
  {
    "event": "hiroko_lv1_or_instrument_panic",
    "source_node": "A002",
    "speaker": "narrator",
    "source_text": "另一边，本庄萌恵正兴致勃勃地整理器械台。金属器械一件接一件排开，在手术灯下反着冷光。",
    "status": "not_exact_substring_in_current_nodes; requires revision provenance review"
  },
  {
    "event": "hiroko_lv1_or_instrument_panic",
    "source_node": "A007",
    "speaker": "narrator",
    "source_text": "本庄低头看看摆得满满的器械台，很认真地点头。",
    "status": "not_exact_substring_in_current_nodes; requires revision provenance review"
  },
  {
    "event": "hiroko_lv1_or_instrument_panic",
    "source_node": "A008",
    "speaker": "moe",
    "source_text": "「是啊。你今天这个术式比较大，所以会准备得多一点。」",
    "status": "not_exact_substring_in_current_nodes; requires revision provenance review"
  },
  {
    "event": "hiroko_lv1_or_instrument_panic",
    "source_node": "A009",
    "speaker": "patient",
    "source_text": "「多……一点？」",
    "status": "not_exact_substring_in_current_nodes; requires revision provenance review"
  },
  {
    "event": "hiroko_lv1_or_instrument_panic",
    "source_node": "A010",
    "speaker": "moe",
    "source_text": "「嗯。刀子会换几把，剪刀也有好几种，这边这些钳子——」",
    "status": "not_exact_substring_in_current_nodes; requires revision provenance review"
  },
  {
    "event": "hiroko_lv1_or_instrument_panic",
    "source_node": "A012",
    "speaker": "narrator",
    "source_text": "弘子的声音从她身后响起。",
    "status": "not_exact_substring_in_current_nodes; requires revision provenance review"
  },
  {
    "event": "hiroko_lv1_or_instrument_panic",
    "source_node": "A013",
    "speaker": "moe",
    "source_text": "「嗯？杉村前辈？」",
    "status": "not_exact_substring_in_current_nodes; requires revision provenance review"
  },
  {
    "event": "hiroko_lv1_or_instrument_panic",
    "source_node": "A014",
    "speaker": "narrator",
    "source_text": "患者却已经完全移不开视线。她看着器械台上一排又一排金属器械，脸色一点点发白。",
    "status": "not_exact_substring_in_current_nodes; requires revision provenance review"
  },
  {
    "event": "hiroko_lv1_or_instrument_panic",
    "source_node": "A015",
    "speaker": "patient",
    "source_text": "「等、等等……这些刀子、剪子、钳子……」",
    "status": "not_exact_substring_in_current_nodes; requires revision provenance review"
  },
  {
    "event": "hiroko_lv1_or_instrument_panic",
    "source_node": "A016",
    "speaker": "patient",
    "source_text": "「等一下……全部都会用在我身上吗？」",
    "status": "not_exact_substring_in_current_nodes; requires revision provenance review"
  },
  {
    "event": "hiroko_lv1_or_instrument_panic",
    "source_node": "A017",
    "speaker": "narrator",
    "source_text": "本庄毫无恶意地露出笑容。",
    "status": "not_exact_substring_in_current_nodes; requires revision provenance review"
  },
  {
    "event": "hiroko_lv1_or_instrument_panic",
    "source_node": "A020",
    "speaker": "patient",
    "source_text": "「开、开腹……」",
    "status": "not_exact_substring_in_current_nodes; requires revision provenance review"
  },
  {
    "event": "hiroko_lv1_or_instrument_panic",
    "source_node": "A021",
    "speaker": "narrator",
    "source_text": "患者猛地想坐起来。",
    "status": "not_exact_substring_in_current_nodes; requires revision provenance review"
  },
  {
    "event": "hiroko_lv1_or_instrument_panic",
    "source_node": "A023",
    "speaker": "narrator",
    "source_text": "监护仪上的心率骤然往上跳。她慌乱地挣动了一下，手术单随之滑动，弘子立刻上前替她重新盖好。",
    "status": "not_exact_substring_in_current_nodes; requires revision provenance review"
  },
  {
    "event": "hiroko_lv1_or_instrument_panic",
    "source_node": "A024",
    "speaker": "patient",
    "source_text": "「等一下、我要下去……让我回病房……！」",
    "status": "not_exact_substring_in_current_nodes; requires revision provenance review"
  },
  {
    "event": "hiroko_lv1_or_instrument_panic",
    "source_node": "A025",
    "speaker": "moe",
    "source_text": "「哎？可是都已经准备好了——」",
    "status": "not_exact_substring_in_current_nodes; requires revision provenance review"
  },
  {
    "event": "hiroko_lv1_or_instrument_panic",
    "source_node": "A027",
    "speaker": "narrator",
    "source_text": "弘子没有提高声音，却让本庄立刻闭上了嘴。",
    "status": "not_exact_substring_in_current_nodes; requires revision provenance review"
  },
  {
    "event": "hiroko_lv1_or_instrument_panic",
    "source_node": "A028",
    "speaker": "narrator",
    "source_text": "下一秒，患者身体突然僵住。她像是意识到了什么，惊恐的表情瞬间又变成羞耻。",
    "status": "not_exact_substring_in_current_nodes; requires revision provenance review"
  },
  {
    "event": "hiroko_lv1_or_instrument_panic",
    "source_node": "A029",
    "speaker": "patient",
    "source_text": "「……啊。」",
    "status": "not_exact_substring_in_current_nodes; requires revision provenance review"
  },
  {
    "event": "hiroko_lv1_or_instrument_panic",
    "source_node": "A030",
    "speaker": "patient",
    "source_text": "「不、不要看……」",
    "status": "not_exact_substring_in_current_nodes; requires revision provenance review"
  },
  {
    "event": "hiroko_lv1_or_instrument_panic",
    "source_node": "A032",
    "speaker": "patient",
    "source_text": "「对不起……对不起……我不是故意的……」",
    "status": "not_exact_substring_in_current_nodes; requires revision provenance review"
  },
  {
    "event": "hiroko_lv1_or_instrument_panic",
    "source_node": "A033",
    "speaker": "moe",
    "source_text": "「啊……！」",
    "status": "not_exact_substring_in_current_nodes; requires revision provenance review"
  },
  {
    "event": "hiroko_lv1_or_instrument_panic",
    "source_node": "A034",
    "speaker": "hiroko",
    "source_text": "「没关系。」",
    "status": "not_exact_substring_in_current_nodes; requires revision provenance review"
  },
  {
    "event": "hiroko_lv1_or_instrument_panic",
    "source_node": "A035",
    "speaker": "narrator",
    "source_text": "弘子几乎没有停顿。她先把患者露出的部分重新遮严，又示意拿来干净的垫单。",
    "status": "not_exact_substring_in_current_nodes; requires revision provenance review"
  },
  {
    "event": "hiroko_lv1_or_instrument_panic",
    "source_node": "A036",
    "speaker": "hiroko",
    "source_text": "「你没有做错任何事。只是太紧张了。」",
    "status": "not_exact_substring_in_current_nodes; requires revision provenance review"
  },
  {
    "event": "hiroko_lv1_or_instrument_panic",
    "source_node": "A037",
    "speaker": "patient",
    "source_text": "「可是……大家都……」",
    "status": "not_exact_substring_in_current_nodes; requires revision provenance review"
  },
  {
    "event": "hiroko_lv1_or_instrument_panic",
    "source_node": "A038",
    "speaker": "hiroko",
    "source_text": "「大家都是医护人员。」",
    "status": "not_exact_substring_in_current_nodes; requires revision provenance review"
  },
  {
    "event": "hiroko_lv1_or_instrument_panic",
    "source_node": "A039",
    "speaker": "hiroko",
    "source_text": "「这种情况不是第一次，也绝不会是最后一次。」",
    "status": "not_exact_substring_in_current_nodes; requires revision provenance review"
  },
  {
    "event": "hiroko_lv1_or_instrument_panic",
    "source_node": "A040",
    "speaker": "narrator",
    "source_text": "她说得很平静，像是在陈述最普通不过的事实。",
    "status": "not_exact_substring_in_current_nodes; requires revision provenance review"
  },
  {
    "event": "hiroko_lv1_or_instrument_panic",
    "source_node": "A042",
    "speaker": "patient",
    "source_text": "「……嗯。」",
    "status": "not_exact_substring_in_current_nodes; requires revision provenance review"
  },
  {
    "event": "hiroko_lv1_or_instrument_panic",
    "source_node": "A045",
    "speaker": "hiroko",
    "source_text": "「明白。」",
    "status": "not_exact_substring_in_current_nodes; requires revision provenance review"
  },
  {
    "event": "hiroko_lv1_or_instrument_panic",
    "source_node": "A046",
    "speaker": "narrator",
    "source_text": "弘子确认药物与患者信息后，经静脉通路给入术前镇静药。\n\n> 实现要求：这里只作为剧情描述，不建立真实剂量或药理计算。",
    "status": "not_exact_substring_in_current_nodes; requires revision provenance review"
  },
  {
    "event": "hiroko_lv1_or_instrument_panic",
    "source_node": "A049",
    "speaker": "hiroko",
    "source_text": "「不要看那边。」",
    "status": "not_exact_substring_in_current_nodes; requires revision provenance review"
  },
  {
    "event": "hiroko_lv1_or_instrument_panic",
    "source_node": "A050",
    "speaker": "hiroko",
    "source_text": "「看着我。」",
    "status": "not_exact_substring_in_current_nodes; requires revision provenance review"
  },
  {
    "event": "hiroko_lv1_or_instrument_panic",
    "source_node": "A051",
    "speaker": "narrator",
    "source_text": "患者紧紧盯着弘子的眼睛。几次急促呼吸以后，肩膀终于慢慢松了下来。",
    "status": "not_exact_substring_in_current_nodes; requires revision provenance review"
  },
  {
    "event": "hiroko_lv1_or_instrument_panic",
    "source_node": "A052",
    "speaker": "patient",
    "source_text": "「……杉村护士。」",
    "status": "not_exact_substring_in_current_nodes; requires revision provenance review"
  },
  {
    "event": "hiroko_lv1_or_instrument_panic",
    "source_node": "A053",
    "speaker": "hiroko",
    "source_text": "「我在。」",
    "status": "not_exact_substring_in_current_nodes; requires revision provenance review"
  },
  {
    "event": "hiroko_lv1_or_instrument_panic",
    "source_node": "A054",
    "speaker": "patient",
    "source_text": "「等我睡着以后……才会开始，对吧？」",
    "status": "not_exact_substring_in_current_nodes; requires revision provenance review"
  },
  {
    "event": "hiroko_lv1_or_instrument_panic",
    "source_node": "A055",
    "speaker": "hiroko",
    "source_text": "「对。」",
    "status": "not_exact_substring_in_current_nodes; requires revision provenance review"
  },
  {
    "event": "hiroko_lv1_or_instrument_panic",
    "source_node": "A056",
    "speaker": "hiroko",
    "source_text": "「你睡着以前，没有人会动刀。」",
    "status": "not_exact_substring_in_current_nodes; requires revision provenance review"
  },
  {
    "event": "hiroko_lv1_or_instrument_panic",
    "source_node": "A057",
    "speaker": "narrator",
    "source_text": "患者轻轻点头。她的眼皮开始变沉。",
    "status": "not_exact_substring_in_current_nodes; requires revision provenance review"
  },
  {
    "event": "hiroko_lv1_or_instrument_panic",
    "source_node": "A060",
    "speaker": "narrator",
    "source_text": "直到患者终于安静下来，弘子才转过身。",
    "status": "not_exact_substring_in_current_nodes; requires revision provenance review"
  },
  {
    "event": "hiroko_lv1_or_instrument_panic",
    "source_node": "A061",
    "speaker": "narrator",
    "source_text": "本庄已经把器械台默默往旁边推了半步，脸上的兴奋早就消失得无影无踪。",
    "status": "not_exact_substring_in_current_nodes; requires revision provenance review"
  },
  {
    "event": "hiroko_lv1_or_instrument_panic",
    "source_node": "A062",
    "speaker": "moe",
    "source_text": "「杉村前辈……对不起。」",
    "status": "not_exact_substring_in_current_nodes; requires revision provenance review"
  },
  {
    "event": "hiroko_lv1_or_instrument_panic",
    "source_node": "A063",
    "speaker": "hiroko",
    "source_text": "「你为什么道歉？」",
    "status": "not_exact_substring_in_current_nodes; requires revision provenance review"
  },
  {
    "event": "hiroko_lv1_or_instrument_panic",
    "source_node": "A064",
    "speaker": "moe",
    "source_text": "「因为……是我把她吓成这样的。」",
    "status": "not_exact_substring_in_current_nodes; requires revision provenance review"
  },
  {
    "event": "hiroko_lv1_or_instrument_panic",
    "source_node": "A065",
    "speaker": "hiroko",
    "source_text": "「你没有说错。」",
    "status": "not_exact_substring_in_current_nodes; requires revision provenance review"
  },
  {
    "event": "hiroko_lv1_or_instrument_panic",
    "source_node": "A066",
    "speaker": "narrator",
    "source_text": "本庄抬起头。",
    "status": "not_exact_substring_in_current_nodes; requires revision provenance review"
  },
  {
    "event": "hiroko_lv1_or_instrument_panic",
    "source_node": "A067",
    "speaker": "hiroko",
    "source_text": "「问题就是你说得太对了。」",
    "status": "not_exact_substring_in_current_nodes; requires revision provenance review"
  },
  {
    "event": "hiroko_lv1_or_instrument_panic",
    "source_node": "A068",
    "speaker": "moe",
    "source_text": "「……咦？」",
    "status": "not_exact_substring_in_current_nodes; requires revision provenance review"
  },
  {
    "event": "hiroko_lv1_or_instrument_panic",
    "source_node": "A069",
    "speaker": "narrator",
    "source_text": "弘子走到器械台旁，把它彻底推离患者醒着时能够看到的位置。",
    "status": "not_exact_substring_in_current_nodes; requires revision provenance review"
  },
  {
    "event": "hiroko_lv1_or_instrument_panic",
    "source_node": "A070",
    "speaker": "hiroko",
    "source_text": "「对我们来说，这些只是每天都会碰到的器械。」",
    "status": "not_exact_substring_in_current_nodes; requires revision provenance review"
  },
  {
    "event": "hiroko_lv1_or_instrument_panic",
    "source_node": "A071",
    "speaker": "hiroko",
    "source_text": "「对躺在那里的人来说，每一把都代表『等一下可能会发生在自己身上的事情』。」",
    "status": "not_exact_substring_in_current_nodes; requires revision provenance review"
  },
  {
    "event": "hiroko_lv1_or_instrument_panic",
    "source_node": "A072",
    "speaker": "narrator",
    "source_text": "本庄低头看了一眼手术刀。",
    "status": "not_exact_substring_in_current_nodes; requires revision provenance review"
  },
  {
    "event": "hiroko_lv1_or_instrument_panic",
    "source_node": "A073",
    "speaker": "hiroko",
    "source_text": "「患者还清醒的时候，不要把整个器械台摆进她视线里。」",
    "status": "not_exact_substring_in_current_nodes; requires revision provenance review"
  },
  {
    "event": "hiroko_lv1_or_instrument_panic",
    "source_node": "A074",
    "speaker": "hiroko",
    "source_text": "「尤其是大手术。」",
    "status": "not_exact_substring_in_current_nodes; requires revision provenance review"
  },
  {
    "event": "hiroko_lv1_or_instrument_panic",
    "source_node": "A076",
    "speaker": "hiroko",
    "source_text": "「还有。」",
    "status": "not_exact_substring_in_current_nodes; requires revision provenance review"
  },
  {
    "event": "hiroko_lv1_or_instrument_panic",
    "source_node": "A077",
    "speaker": "moe",
    "source_text": "「是。」",
    "status": "not_exact_substring_in_current_nodes; requires revision provenance review"
  },
  {
    "event": "hiroko_lv1_or_instrument_panic",
    "source_node": "A078",
    "speaker": "hiroko",
    "source_text": "「患者问『这些是不是都会用在我身上』的时候——」",
    "status": "not_exact_substring_in_current_nodes; requires revision provenance review"
  },
  {
    "event": "hiroko_lv1_or_instrument_panic",
    "source_node": "A079",
    "speaker": "narrator",
    "source_text": "弘子忍不住轻轻叹气。",
    "status": "not_exact_substring_in_current_nodes; requires revision provenance review"
  },
  {
    "event": "hiroko_lv1_or_instrument_panic",
    "source_node": "A080",
    "speaker": "hiroko",
    "source_text": "「不要一脸开心地回答『是啊』。」",
    "status": "not_exact_substring_in_current_nodes; requires revision provenance review"
  },
  {
    "event": "hiroko_lv1_worth_it",
    "source_node": "B001",
    "speaker": "narrator",
    "source_text": "第二天经过护士站时，主角看见弘子一个人坐在交班记录前。",
    "status": "not_exact_substring_in_current_nodes; requires revision provenance review"
  },
  {
    "event": "hiroko_lv1_worth_it",
    "source_node": "B005",
    "speaker": "player",
    "source_text": "「她为什么要道歉？」",
    "status": "not_exact_substring_in_current_nodes; requires revision provenance review"
  },
  {
    "event": "hiroko_lv1_worth_it",
    "source_node": "B006",
    "speaker": "hiroko",
    "source_text": "「因为昨天的事。」",
    "status": "not_exact_substring_in_current_nodes; requires revision provenance review"
  },
  {
    "event": "hiroko_lv1_worth_it",
    "source_node": "B007",
    "speaker": "player",
    "source_text": "「那又不是她的错。」",
    "status": "not_exact_substring_in_current_nodes; requires revision provenance review"
  },
  {
    "event": "hiroko_lv1_worth_it",
    "source_node": "B009",
    "speaker": "player",
    "source_text": "「昨天你处理得很好。」",
    "status": "not_exact_substring_in_current_nodes; requires revision provenance review"
  },
  {
    "event": "hiroko_lv1_worth_it",
    "source_node": "B010",
    "speaker": "hiroko",
    "source_text": "「……突然这么说什么？」",
    "status": "not_exact_substring_in_current_nodes; requires revision provenance review"
  },
  {
    "event": "hiroko_lv1_worth_it",
    "source_node": "B011",
    "speaker": "player",
    "source_text": "「患者失控的时候，你一下就把场面稳住了。」",
    "status": "not_exact_substring_in_current_nodes; requires revision provenance review"
  },
  {
    "event": "hiroko_lv1_worth_it",
    "source_node": "B012",
    "speaker": "player",
    "source_text": "「本庄也没被你骂到抬不起头。」",
    "status": "not_exact_substring_in_current_nodes; requires revision provenance review"
  },
  {
    "event": "hiroko_lv1_worth_it",
    "source_node": "B013",
    "speaker": "hiroko",
    "source_text": "「她又不是故意的。」",
    "status": "not_exact_substring_in_current_nodes; requires revision provenance review"
  },
  {
    "event": "hiroko_lv1_worth_it",
    "source_node": "B014",
    "speaker": "hiroko",
    "source_text": "「萌恵只是……有时候会忘记，自己知道的东西，患者并不知道。」",
    "status": "not_exact_substring_in_current_nodes; requires revision provenance review"
  },
  {
    "event": "hiroko_lv1_worth_it",
    "source_node": "B015",
    "speaker": "player",
    "source_text": "「你昨天还在手术结束以后教她？」",
    "status": "not_exact_substring_in_current_nodes; requires revision provenance review"
  },
  {
    "event": "hiroko_lv1_worth_it",
    "source_node": "B016",
    "speaker": "hiroko",
    "source_text": "「嗯。」",
    "status": "not_exact_substring_in_current_nodes; requires revision provenance review"
  },
  {
    "event": "hiroko_lv1_worth_it",
    "source_node": "B017",
